      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.4026489257812,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "Eleven (61%) respondents also raised concern about increased out-of-pocket spending for contacts,",
